  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender Equality and Women&#x2019;s Empowerment Program (GEWEP) III - Mali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vulnerable women and girls (of whom 410 000 will be direct participants) in 4 regions (Mopti, Segou, Tombouctou and Bougouni) in Mali are economically, socially and politically empowered and actively participate in the development of their society.  Increase knowledge of SRHR and training of health staff on SRHR service provision, and tranform norms relating to gender-based violence.</narrative>
  </description>
